# Optional. Without this the app is entirely offline and rules-only.
#
# When set, a language model is consulted ONLY for a document the rules could not
# read — a missing consignee, an unread block, a form that needed realigning.
# A cleanly-read pair never leaves the machine.
#
# Free key (Google account, no credit card): https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Note: on Google's free tier, submitted text may be used to improve their models.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Pin an explicit model. Aliases like "gemini-flash-latest" drift and overload,
# and lite models are measurably worse at telling loading from discharge ports.
# Run `npm run llm:check` to list what your key can actually use.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash

# Set to "off" to disable assistance without removing the key.
# LLM_ASSIST=off
